    <h2>Ordering Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First timer?</strong> Order a Mini ($4.49) to try it before committing to a full cup.</li>
      <li><strong>Best size for one person:</strong> Small ($5.29) (490 calories) is plenty for one person.</li>
      <li><strong>Upgrade option:</strong> Ask to blend in a hot fudge swirl for richer chocolate depth, or add extra mix-ins (~$0.50).</li>
      <li><strong>Check the flip:</strong> Staff traditionally hand every Blizzard over upside down to show it is thick enough to hold.</li>
    </ul>

